-- The same small programs, with a collection on every allocation and every seventh: what only a collection at the wrong moment finds
reference programs_agree_every(model, real, every)
under test: program, op, on, past, pace
defaults trials = 10, size = 3
use "check/laws/gc-programs.law"

fact pace(1)
fact pace(7)

law programs_paced: all p: program(p), e: pace(e). programs_agree_every(() -> model_run(p), () -> real_program(p), e) = accept
